        <mxCell id="c51" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 14.3, two versions of the table of Requirement 5. Left, Revenue PY as first written: the year 2027 has a Revenue PY, the revenue of 2026, and no revenue, and the first year, 2024, has revenue and no Revenue PY (outlined in teal). Right, Revenue PY as changed, blank wherever Revenue is blank: both measures are blank for 2027, so the table drops its row (drawn dashed). The totals do not change.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="250" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
